---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import refs from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-07/references.json';
import v from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-07/verification.json';
const a='/equipment/06-07/';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Fluigent MFCS-EZ · Documentary exhibit" subtitle="" description="Inspect the dormant four-position MFCS-EZ enclosure and compare marks on a separate drafting panel." wide={true}>
<article class="equipment ez0607">
<nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/06-07/">← Equipment 06-07</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#evidence">Sources &amp; checks</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><span class="eq-meta">06-07 / Documentary enclosure and detached drawing</span><h2>Fluigent MFCS-EZ · Enclosure &amp; drafting panel</h2><p>Inspect the blue-front, four-position MFCS-EZ enclosure from both sides. On a separate drawing, compare the spacing of four fixed dots and mirror their displayed coordinates. The cabinet is unpowered and disconnected.</p></header>
<div class="dn-grid"><section class="dn-card"><h3>3D exhibit</h3>
<div class="dn-bar"><button data-view="whole">Whole exhibit</button><button data-view="front">Front face</button><button data-view="rear">Rear face</button><button data-view="chart">Drafting plaque</button><button id="camera-reset">Reset view</button></div>
<div class="dn-camera"><canvas id="ez-model" aria-label="Dormant blue-front MFCS-EZ enclosure with a separate digital drafting plaque"></canvas></div>
<p id="asset" class="dn-note" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="dn-note">Drag to orbit, pinch or scroll to zoom. The gold plaque key cycles the dot pair; the pale key mirrors the drawing. Neither key interacts with the cabinet. All four front faces and the rear details are permanently capped representations.</p></section>
<section class="dn-card"><h3>Compare four drawn dots</h3><div class="dn-bar"><label>Dots <select id="pair"><option value="AB">A → B</option><option value="BC">B → C</option><option value="CD">C → D</option><option value="AD">A → D</option><option value="AA">A → A</option></select></label><button class="primary" id="mirror" aria-pressed="false">Mirror drawing</button><button id="reset">Reset view</button></div>
<canvas id="draft" width="438" height="245" role="img" aria-label="Four equal-spaced dots on an original drafting panel with horizontal coordinates in millimetres"></canvas>
<p class="dn-note" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">A → B · distance 30 mm · signed ΔX +30 mm · midpoint X 45 mm.</p>
<div class="dn-bar"><button id="json">Export drawing JSON</button><a href={a+'example-panel.json'}>Example reading</a></div>
<p class="dn-note">The original 150 × 75 mm drawing has four evenly spaced marks. Mirroring maps X to 150 − X and leaves the original drawing intact. Absolute separation stays fixed; signed displacement reverses. The four drawn dots do not locate or describe the cabinet's hardware.</p></section></div>
<section id="evidence"><h3>Sources and geometric verification</h3>
<div class="photo-pair">
<figure><img src={a+'reference-front.webp'} width="560" height="330" alt="Original Blender render of the authored front shell, blue band, dark display and blind face caps" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original front render from the GLB. Compared to the actual photograph in the <a href={refs.references[1].url}>manufacturer manual, p. 9</a>; four center fractions checked below.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src={a+'reference-rear.webp'} width="560" height="330" alt="Original Blender render of the sealed rear and representative recessed silhouettes" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original rear render from the GLB. The same manual p. 9 establishes positions of the round, dark rectangular and square silhouettes. These are not functioning jacks.</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<ul>{refs.references.map(r=><li><a href={r.url}>{r.title}</a>. {r.caption}</li>)}</ul>
<p>The selected model is the four-position MFCS-EZ, not the eight-position MFCS-EX. The 230 × 160 × 63 mm (W × D × H) envelope is the nominal casing basis from the manufacturer datasheet p. 2. The decorative caps project beyond this envelope. A legacy manual lists 65 mm height; that number was not used. The front and rear positions are photo estimates, not measured dimensions. No routing, sample workflow, pressure, flow mechanics, instrument control or biological procedures are represented.</p>
<div class="dn-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Tolerance</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>{v.checks.map(c=><tr><th scope="row">{c.id}</th><td>{String(c.expected)} {c.unit}</td><td>{typeof c.actual==='number'?Number(c.actual.toFixed(8)):String(c.actual)} {c.unit}</td><td>{c.tolerance===0?'Exact':c.tolerance}</td><td>{c.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'build-model.py'} download>Editable model</a> · <a href={a+'mfcs-ez-dormant.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'references.json'}>Reference notes</a> · <a href={a+'vr-station.json'}>VR action manifest</a> · <a href={a+'panel.mjs'}>Geometry module</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification JSON</a>. No headset session tested.</p>
</section></article></Layout><script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/06-07/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
.ez0607{--dn-rule:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 26%,transparent);max-width:1280px;margin:auto}.dn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}.dn-card{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.85rem;margin:.8rem 0}.dn-card h3{margin:.21rem 0 .6rem}.dn-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin:.53rem 0}.dn-bar,.dn-note,.dn-fig figcaption{font:.89rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}
.ez0607 :is(button,select){font:inherit;padding:.4rem;background:var(--panel,Canvas);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);border-radius:3px;min-height:38px;cursor:pointer}.ez0607 .primary{background:#34594f;color:#fff}.dn-camera{aspect-ratio:1.34;background:#263b40}.dn-camera canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}.ez0607 #draft{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:492px;margin:.6rem 0}.dn-table{overflow:auto}.dn-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.dn-table :is(td,th){border-bottom:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.42rem;text-align:left}.dn-fig{margin:1rem 0;max-width:680px}.dn-fig img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.dn-fig figcaption{margin:.38rem 0}@media(max-width:850px){.dn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.ez0607 .photo-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;max-width:860px}.ez0607 .photo-pair figure{margin:0}.ez0607 .photo-pair img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.ez0607 .photo-pair figcaption{font:.86rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif;margin:.3rem 0}@media(max-width:600px){.ez0607 .photo-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
